= Foundations

Folio relies on a state-driven philosophy: *One data dictionary (`dt.typ`) produces many documents.*

== The Six Pillar Architecture

We map standard PMBOK and PRINCE2 concepts to six core namespaces. These pillars are divided into static components (the contract) and dynamic components (the execution).

#align(center)[
  #box(stroke: 1pt + gray, inset: 10pt, radius: 4pt)[
    *Data Contract* \
    1. Metadata \
    2. Initiation \
    3. Baselines \
    4. Registers \
    5. Governance \
    6. Closure
  ]
]

In the next chapters, we will use the "Aurora Cloud Migration" project as our shared fixture to explore these pillars.
